    "title": "Which chain, fast food restaurants are open on Easter?",
    "text": "April 2, 2026Updated April 5, 2026, 12:05 a.m. ETHip, hop, hurray! Easter, a Christian holiday commemorating the resurrection of Jesus Christ, lands this Sunday, marking the end of the 40-day lenten season, a time of prayer, fasting and giving.Restaurants that are typically closed Sundays, such as Chick-fil-A, are also closed on Easter. But for those looking to celebrate the end of Lent with fast food, there are plenty of other quick-service and dine-in restaurants that stay open.Looking for a place to eat on Easter? Here's a list of drive-thru restaurants, coffee shops, quick service and sit-down restaurants open for Easter 2026.Note: Hours may vary by location, so it's always best to call ahead and double-check whether the restaurant you'd like to eat at is open and/or doesn't have modified hours.When is Easter 2026?Easter falls on April 5 this year.Fast food restaurants open on Easter SundayBurger King.Dairy Queen.McDonald's.Taco Bell.Wendy’s.Coffee shops open on Easter SundayDunkin'.Starbucks.Chain restaurants open on Easter SundayApplebee's.Buffalo Wild Wings.Cheesecake Factory.Chili'sCracker Barrel.Golden Corral.IHOP.P.F. Chang'sPanera Bread.What grocery stores will be open and closed on Easter Sunday?Aldi: Closed.Costco: Closed.Jungle Jim's: Open 8 a.m. to 8 p.m.Kroger: Most stores will be open.Meijer: Open from 6 a.m. to midnight.Sam's Club: Closed.Target: Closed.Trader Joe's: Stores open regular hours.Walmart: Stores open regular hours.Whole Foods: Most stores are open, but hours may vary.",
